rs3-rpr-rotation-converter
==========================

This project bundles data derived from third-party community projects.

RotationMaster
--------------
Files: src/data/abilities.json, src/data/pvme.json
Source: https://github.com/Ellamental2/RotationMaster (branch: master)
The exact upstream commit these copies were taken from is recorded in
src/data/ASSETS_MANIFEST.json and can be refreshed with `npm run update-assets`.
Ability icons and emoji data originate from the PVME Discord community.

PVME Guides
-----------
Rotation notation and ability naming conventions follow the PVME guides project:
https://github.com/pvme/pvme-guides — content there is published under a
Creative Commons licence (see that repository for details).

RS Analysis
-----------
The RS Analysis save/export format is reproduced by observation of files created
with the RS Analysis tool (https://tools.runescape.wiki/rs-rot).

